ate":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T05:14:49-08:00","id":314394,"title":"","content":"Their powerset, do you mean are we trying to balance their powers against the kuei-jin, shifters, etc? We're not, we're biting our nails and limiting the players for now.<br /> <br /> And this is set in Kyoto, so not the PvP zone that Tokyo is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3920-sarah-rps","name":"Sarah RPs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T07:11:24-08:00","id":314478,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sarah RPs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/283865-a-nice-introductory-plot-to-land-of-8-million-dreams?p=314394#post314394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Their powerset, do you mean are we trying to balance their powers against the kuei-jin, shifters, etc?</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe Lian means &quot;which larp rules translation are you using?&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid"